<div id="A1.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The following example illustrates a typical case where the model-generated continuation remains semantically and lexically distinct from the ground truth, thereby avoiding the leakage threshold:</p>
